@startuml
title Diagrama de Componentes — ms-proveedores [PRV]

!define COMPONENT(x) component x

package "Cliente" {
  COMPONENT(ClienteAPI) as "Cliente API\nHTTP/REST"
}

package "ms-proveedores [PRV]" {
  COMPONENT(FastAPIApp) as "FastAPI App\n(main.py)"

  COMPONENT(MiddlewareLayer) as "Middleware ASGI"
  COMPONENT(LoggingMiddleware) as "LoggingMiddleware\nX-Process-Time"
  COMPONENT(RequestIDMiddleware) as "RequestIDMiddleware\nX-Request-ID"

  COMPONENT(Routes) as "Rutas REST\n(app/routes/provider.py)"

  COMPONENT(Dependencies) as "Dependencias\n(app/dependencies.py)"

  COMPONENT(Schemas) as "Schemas Pydantic\n(app/schemas/provider.py)"

  COMPONENT(Services) as "Servicios\n(app/services/provider.py)"

  COMPONENT(Clients) as "Clientes HTTP\n(app/clients.py)"

  COMPONENT(Models) as "Modelos ORM\n(app/models/models.py)"

  COMPONENT(Utils) as "Utilidades\n(app/utils/core.py)"
}

database "PostgreSQL" {
  COMPONENT(DB) as "Base de Datos\nproveedores"
}

package "Microservicios Externos" {
  COMPONENT(msAuth) as "ms-autenticacion\n/auth/session/validate"
  COMPONENT(msRoles) as "ms-roles\n/permisos/validar"
  COMPONENT(msAudit) as "ms-auditoria\n/logs"
  COMPONENT(msNotif) as "ms-notificaciones\n/notificaciones/alerta"
}

ClienteAPI --> FastAPIApp : HTTP REST

FastAPIApp --> MiddlewareLayer : registra
MiddlewareLayer --> LoggingMiddleware : incluye
MiddlewareLayer --> RequestIDMiddleware : incluye
MiddlewareLayer --> Routes : procesa

Routes --> Dependencies : valida sesion/rol
Routes --> Services : invoca logica
Routes --> Schemas : valida request/response
Routes --> Utils : genera respuesta estandar

Dependencies --> Clients : valida sesion
Services --> Models : CRUD
Services --> Clients : notifica (async)
Services --> Schemas : usa DTOs

Models --> DB : persiste (Peewee)

Clients --> msAuth : POST /session/validate
Clients --> msRoles : POST /permisos/validar
Clients --> msAudit : POST /logs (background)
Clients --> msNotif : POST /notificaciones/alerta

note right of Dependencies
Validacion transversal:
- get_current_user (via AuthClient)
- RoleChecker (rol en lista permitida)
- registrar_auditoria_bg (BackgroundTasks)
end note

note right of Clients
Comunicacion con microservicios:
- AuthClient: validar sesion
- RolesClient: validar permisos
- NotificacionesClient: alertas
- AuditoriaClient: registro
end note

@enduml
